Description: CVE-2026-61861 — false positive for Debian bookworm ImageMagick 6.9.11.60
 Debian marks this CVE <not-affected> (vulnerable code not present). The
 FormatMagickCaption use-after-free (GHSA-qvxh-prvr-85w2) was introduced
 with ReplaceSpaceWithNewline() in ImageMagick6 6.9.12-24, after the
 6.9.11.60 tree shipped in bookworm.
Origin: not-applicable
Author: Root.io <security@root.io>
